<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 17,647 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 17,647 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>SALVADOR, Brazil 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 17,647 bags in the week ending January 12 compared to 59,212 bags in the corresponding week to January 14 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,596,736 bags against 2,268,429 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>((-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
